WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.275 --> 00:00:04.538
Before starting another application, download or
save the approved check if

2
00:00:04.538 --> 00:00:08.825
you want to keep it. Under Your next application,
choose which CV to

3
00:00:08.825 --> 00:00:13.538
reuse: Reviewed source CV or Approved final CV. The

4
00:00:13.538 --> 00:00:18.300
choice replaces the open check; saved applications
stay unchanged.

5
00:00:18.725 --> 00:00:23.312
Select Use this CV for another vacancy. Enter the
new target role and

6
00:00:23.312 --> 00:00:28.225
optional company, review the reused CV and paste the
new posting.

7
00:00:28.225 --> 00:00:32.925
Work through the evidence and your review again. A
previous approval cannot

8
00:00:32.925 --> 00:00:36.725
approve this new combination of CV and vacancy.

9
00:00:37.150 --> 00:00:41.775
In Job Loop, your saved career record and unchanged
cleared facts are already

10
00:00:41.775 --> 00:00:46.525
available. Add the next real vacancy in
Opportunities. Inspect

11
00:00:46.525 --> 00:00:51.463
available preparation on Today, then review the new
document in Outputs.

12
00:00:51.463 --> 00:00:55.725
Every packet still has its own source checks and
exact approval.

13
00:00:56.150 --> 00:01:00.700
Submit on the employer site yourself. When you have
actually applied, update

14
00:01:00.700 --> 00:01:05.663
Application status in Opportunities and confirm that
you report it. Add

15
00:01:05.663 --> 00:01:10.438
a follow-up date and notes if helpful, then select
Save tracking update.

16
00:01:10.438 --> 00:01:15.200
Preparing or downloading a CV does not mean an
application was submitted.
